From 8008f0532aafb6b032bea020ccb95406aa8e1171 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hoangvu12 <hggaming91@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:16:32 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] nightly: zgx from hoangvu12/zgx nightly-design, with the
 Design plugin's zgx PRs

The app (apps/zgx) and, with #1367, the engine build against zgx. Both
now take it from hoangvu12/zgx's nightly-design branch at 9274b924, so
they measure text alike: zeron/zgx's pin 06c6d56 with these zgx PRs
cherry-picked onto it:

- #2074 ui.load_font (at bb8dbd37)
- #2080 ui.render_canvas, with its app-fonts and paragraph-wrap fixes
- #2076 canvas text: line height, letter spacing, a wrap width
- #2081 c:image, #2082 c:shadow
- #2094 zgx-text: text shaping and measuring without the renderer

Every zgx line moves: apps/zgx's (its [patch] entries too) from
zeronsh/zgx 06c6d56, the engine's zgx and zgx-text from #2094's own
commit baf248af. The root lock re-resolves zgx's vendored crates at the
branch (zgx-harfrust 0.5.3, as the pin has it); apps/zgx's lock gains
zgx-text, which the engine it builds now needs. Both resolve --locked.
